<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                       
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>Am</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Над домом
своим, над
крышей своей?<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>C</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>/</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>h</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">         
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>Am</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Тарелка
приносит в
наш быт<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>/</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>f</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>#<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>Em</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Забвенье
душевных
обид,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>C</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                   
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>D</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">            
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И темой
для светских
бесед мы
обязаны ей.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Я очень
люблю этот
разряд
посуды, <o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Она украшает
квартиры
моей
экстерьер.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Смотри,
как что-то
летит,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>В
количестве
большем пяти,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Над
домом четыре,
пробив
световой
барьер.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Проигрыш</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>: G Am G Am C C/h Am G G/f# Em C D G G<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И если
внезапно мой
микрофон не
пашет,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И
пьяный
басист
играет
немного не в
такт,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Мне
кажется, это
она,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Намерений
лучших полна,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Над
нами висит,
вступая в
ментальный
контакт.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Видел
ли ты
летающую
тарелку,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Над
крышей своей
висящую,
словно
звезда?<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Мне
кажется, это
не зря;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Ведь
если б
тарелкой был
я,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        
</span>5:</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>III</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'> 5:</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>II</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
